description = "NeoST emulates the Atari ST, STE, Mega ST and Mega STE with a cycle-exact 68000 and chips modelled against the silicon. It reads ST, MSA, DIM, Pasti STX and IPF floppies without any extra library, starts GEMDOS programs directly, frames the picture adaptively and keeps states small and deterministic for run-ahead and netplay."
